<title>HONG KONG: China Aerospace plans new share issue.</title>
<headline>China Aerospace plans new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Aerospace International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would issue 223.2 million new shares to its parent, raising net proceeds of about HK$535 million.</p>
</text>
